OL,3,AGreen deputy leader questioned on small
OL,4,Aboats and polling on BBC local radio
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen Party deputy Rachel Millward
OL,7,Ftells BBC Radio Hereford & Worcester
OL,8,Fher party has had an "absolutely
OL,9,Fhistoric successful year" and defends
OL,10,Fparty leader Zack Polanski's recent
OL,11,Fdrop in polling
OL,13,FOn small boats, she tells Radio Solent
OL,14,F"more safe routes" are needed so people
OL,15,Fcan seek asylum in a "sensible measured
OL,16,Fway"
OL,18,FMeanwhile, she tells Radio Kent that PM
OL,19,FAndy Burnham has been "very vague" on
OL,20,Fhow he plans to tackle failing water
OL,21,Fcompanies
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
