OL,3,AGreen deputy leader questioned on small
OL,4,Aboats and polling on BBC local radio
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe also criticises Reform UK, telling
OL,7,FRadio Newcastle it is "nonsense" that
OL,8,Fthey represent ordinary people
OL,10,FAsked about the latest position on
OL,11,FBirmingham's bin strike, Millward says
OL,12,F"I haven't got the information. I'm so
OL,13,Fsorry". The Greens have run the council
OL,14,Fwith the Lib Dems and independents
OL,15,Fsince May
OL,17,FShe has just finished seven quick-fire
OL,18,Finterviews on BBC local radio stations
OL,19,Fas her party prepares to host its
OL,20,Fautumn conference in Brighton from
OL,21,FFriday
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
